---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { AUTHOR_EMAIL } from '../site.config';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Sobre"
  description="Quem é Otávio Larrosa: trajetória, referências em engenharia de software, livros recomendados e contato."
>
  <main id="main-content" class="app-layout pb-14">
    <div class="max-w-measure mx-auto pt-10 sm:pt-14">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">Oi, eu sou o Otávio</h1>

      <article class="app-prose mt-8">
        <p>
          <a href="http://www.catb.org/~esr/faqs/smart-questions.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            How to ask questions the smart way
          </a>
        </p>
        <p>
          <a href="https://www.vim.org/docs.php" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            Learn vim, for your own good
          </a>
        </p>

        <h2>Quem sou eu</h2>
        <p>
          Atualmente sou Líder de Engenharia de Software na empresa de consultoria Dev.Pro e desenvolvedor de software
          apaixonado por problemas complexos. Minha trajetória atual é focada em sistemas distribuídos, .NET, Azure,
          inteligência artificial e outros assuntos geeks.
        </p>

        <h2>Programadores cujo trabalho eu gosto de acompanhar</h2>
        <ol>
          <li><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ken_Thompson" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ken Thompson</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dennis_Ritchie" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Dennis Ritchie</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Donald_Knuth" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Donald Knuth</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://linkedin.com/in/robertaarcoverde/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Roberta Arcoverde</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Guido_van_Rossum" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Guido Van Rossum</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Linus_Torvalds" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Linus Torvalds</a></li>
        </ol>

        <h2>Livros que recomendo para programadores</h2>
        <ol>
          <li><a href="https://www.amazon.com/Introduction-Algorithms-third-Thomas-Cormen-ebook/dp/B08FH8N996" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Algorithms - Theory and practice</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://www.amazon.com/Distributed-Systems-Principles-Andrew-Tanenbaum/dp/0130888931" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Distributed systems</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://www.amazon.com/Pragmatic-Programmer-Journeyman-Master/dp/020161622X" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">The Pragmatic programmer</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://www.amazon.com/Software-Engineering-Google-Lessons-Programming/dp/1492082791" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Software Engineering at Google</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://www.amazon.com/C-Complete-Reference-Herbert-Schildt/dp/0072226803" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">C++: The Complete Reference</a></li>
        </ol>

        <h2>Como me contatar</h2>
        <p>
          Você pode enviar um e-mail para <a href={`mailto:${AUTHOR_EMAIL}`}>{AUTHOR_EMAIL}</a>
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
